# Device Registration Status

## Database Query Results Needed:
- Total device count
- Device types (iOS/macOS breakdown)
- APNs token presence
- Active status

## Expected Results:
- At least 1 iOS and 1 macOS device registered
- APNs tokens present for active devices
- Devices marked as active

## If Issues Found:
- Devices not registering: Check app authentication flow
- No APNs tokens: Check notification permission requests
- Inactive devices: Check device registration API calls